Package: eha
Title: Event History Analysis
Version: 2.11.4-9999.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Göran", "Broström", , "goran.brostrom@umu.se", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jianming", "Jin", role = "ctb"),
    person("Altan", "Orhon", , "altan@uw.edu", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Parametric proportional hazards fitting with left truncation
    and right censoring for common families of distributions, piecewise
    constant hazards, and discrete models. Parametric accelerated failure
    time models for left truncated and right censored data. Proportional
    hazards models for tabular and register data. Sampling of risk sets in
    Cox regression, selections in the Lexis diagram, bootstrapping.
    Broström (2022) <doi:10.1201/9780429503764>.
